    },
    {
      "id": "cat1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🧾 帳戶與狀態模型",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 163,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf1-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**外部帳戶 EOA**\n由私鑰控制，可主動發起交易"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf1-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 145,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**合約帳戶**\n由程式碼控制，被呼叫才執行"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf1-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 104,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "採帳戶／餘額模型\n（非比特幣的 UTXO）"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ⚙️ EVM 與 Gas",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 669,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 484,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-Gas與EVM.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 674,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 104,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "所有節點跑同一套虛擬機\n→ 得出相同結果、世界狀態一致"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 818,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 104,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "每個操作都有 gas 成本\n防止無窮迴圈與資源濫用"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 📜 智能合約",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1197,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf3-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1012,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-智能合約.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf3-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1202,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 104,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "用 Solidity 等語言撰寫\n部署上鏈後不可變"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf3-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1346,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 104,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "公開可驗證、自動執行\n程式碼即合約"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4",
      "type": "text",
